"type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"UberEats の UX よかったかな、 Chompy も Flutter なんだこれという感動があった","ts":"1614866774.077000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZkG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4dc9caa-231c-4165-a45a-66db6f3572a1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"理念とか、商売の機会とてしは理解するが、やりかたが不味い部分と競合がいるので、利用しないことで抑制の一部のつもり","ts":"1614866745.076400","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1614866841.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qrAS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"864787f5-d47a-4bdc-9be3-09a1a00c6a7e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"企業も得だからそういう風に人を使ってる。","ts":"1614866729.076000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dEfR6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83db697a-f920-41e4-807d-2b40e3180d53","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"得だから、という行動原理がそもそもの原因だよって話。","ts":"1614866712.075400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B5O2R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c619768f-666e-415f-8bb4-6062f45a6451","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ですね。はやく潰れるなら潰れたほうがいい（個人的にはUberEatsのUXはすごくよくて感動したけど）","ts":"1614866704.075000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/OtO+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5f00b79-1166-43c8-af36-6b37f80b89eb","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"チップ払わないほうが得になってしまう","ts":"1614866661.074200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tPdN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6201b6c-e499-4ad0-b8d8-370dbfa385b7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"しかし社会構造が変革しないと囚人のジレンマというか…","ts":"1614866653.073700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eVEk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c34bde1d-c138-4a66-8363-b765a4008a19","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"社会構造に由来するけれども、一瞬一瞬では人と人の関係の話だから。","ts":"1614866634.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pb6w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9985760-f185-4a70-a203-770d851e1ad4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そ。だからささやかでも抵抗する。","ts":"1614866589.072600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jdne4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4929fc48-cef2-46bc-b8af-8e4b9c692781","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"社会構造の問題すねえ","ts":"1614866576.072400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hVD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc836e8b-2b9e-4686-bf07-b0739f81be7a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"企業に金勘定のコスパ重視を許しすぎてる。それは市民のほうもそうなっちゃってるんだけども。","ts":"1614866401.072000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UWWh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2407bc4b-3fc2-42b3-9660-83211aa964b1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"本来はちゃんとした雇用形態であるほうが好ましいけど、日本社会はどんどんそこからは遠ざかってる。","ts":"1614866313.070800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jliy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0639c290-1ba9-4a02-a4e3-70bbf95cc074","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"企業の個々の労働者への搾取構造が強くなってるからこそ、チップみたいな形で適切に支えたい派。","ts":"1614866287.070200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29c40a51-c2ca-4d02-8399-be15c3dba94e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕はいまの状況では逆。","ts":"1614866243.069400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3hH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"364ee8b6-c7b3-4b8f-aa7